      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "stable-diffusion.cpp example (ComfyUI-YogurtNodes)\n\n1. Start sd-server with a model, e.g.\n   sd-server -m <model.safetensors> --listen-port 1234\n2. base_url empty = http://127.0.0.1:1234 (server root, no /v1).\n3. Image Generation (Custom Model): leave model_id empty (sd-server\n   uses its loaded model); size WxH or auto = server default.\n4. sdcpp settings (sampler, steps, cfg, LoRA, img2img, ControlNet,\n   IP-Adapter, hires...) come from the Extra node via extra_params.\n   -1 / 0 / 'default' = not sent.\n5. Interrupting in ComfyUI also cancels the sd-server job."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "stable-diffusion.cpp example (ComfyUI-YogurtNodes)\n\n1. Start sd-server with a model, e.g.\n   sd-server -m <model.safetensors> --listen-port 1234\n2. base_url empty = http://127.0.0.1:1234 (server root, no /v1).\n3. Image Generation (Custom Model): leave model_id empty (sd-server\n   uses its loaded model); size WxH or auto = server default.\n4. sdcpp settings (sampler, steps, cfg, LoRA, img2img, ControlNet,\n   IP-Adapter, hires...) come from the Extra node via extra_params.\n   -1 / 0 / 'default' = not sent.\n5. Interrupting in ComfyUI also cancels the sd-server job."
      },
